ear-gradient(135deg, #FF6B35 0%, #F7931E 100%); color: #ffffff; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 20px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;\">查看模型 →</a>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n        \n        <section style=\"margin-bottom: 24px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n          <section style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF6B35 0%, #F7931E 100%); padding: 12px 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\">\n            <span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;\">#3 Trending Model</span>\n            <span style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); font-size: 12px;\">Hugging Face</span>\n          </section>\n          <section style=\"padding: 0;\">\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-04-05/03-baidu-qianfan-ocr.png\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block;\" alt=\"baidu/Qianfan-OCR\" />\n          </section>\n          <section style=\"padding: 16px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1a1a1a; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4;\">baidu/Qianfan-OCR</h3>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 1.6;\">百度推出的Qianfan-OCR是一款专注于文档智能处理的端到端模型。该模型参数量为5B，能够高效实现图像到文本的转换，主要应用于文档识别、信息提取等OCR场景。它通过统一的架构提升了对复杂文档布局的解析能力与识别精度。</p>\n            <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/baidu/Qianfan-OCR\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF6B35 0%, #F7931E 100%); color: #ffffff; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 20px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;\">查看模型 →</a>\n          </section>\n        </section>\n        \n        <section style=\"margin-bottom: 24px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n          <section style=\"bac